# Preserve OBJ mesh bytes (including source whitespace) so SHA256
# provenance stays valid on Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf enabled -
# without this, a fresh checkout silently rewrites line endings and every
# checksum in a manifest.json stops matching. Applies repo-wide (mouse/
# and human/ outputs both export per-region .obj copies under several
# different subpaths) rather than one narrow path: a previous version of
# this rule only covered mouse/outputs/P56/mesh/ and missed the same
# corruption recurring under mouse/outputs/P56/pathway_meshes/.
*.obj -text -whitespace
